res, with impressive results that remain imperfect predictions.\n\nStudy: \u201cBrain-IT: Image Reconstruction from fMRI via Brain-Interaction Transformer\u201d\n\nDOI: 10.48550/arXiv.2510.25976", "timestamp": "2026-10-22T19:08:52.000Z", "videoDuration": 72.866669, "videoPlayCount": 106094, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 3721, "commentsCount": 89, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-mxp1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/859359436_18022282499944561_252591398384949368_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ig_cache_key=NDAxMzc0Nzc4MDcyNjY4ODI1MjE4MDIyMjgyNTAyOTQ0NTYx.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=hT2W-zVL3UIQ7kNvwFlKdGu&_nc_oc=AdpfDMp3bSRF1b1vs6a6GbSvFSlxnQhVvlCtRayAYbJ-TFDbAPKxiIq_e3ijdMj-z7I&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-mxp1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=IFYOz57rM9-sMSNHEXxikQ&_nc_ss=7a20f&oh=00_AQO1MGJcMXVxXcprglp9olU9DgCWtcnNV7vNwTACbN7mQw&oe=6AE532CD", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQM0TnhNxN6vuiYRn34kNkicAnRY3SVJVQNzr_mvoKmGw9NizyAri4z1MEmOB2ZcElzGKGwtLIvq3EK7R5ZoF-7UgISsgF6y806e2f0.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=3xPPOYyQd1oQ7kNvwGlDuEC&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTAwMjY0NjkyNjE4NDg2NCwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjMsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMDk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjo3MiwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=a180591ef3159274&_nc_&_nc_gid=IFYOz57rM9-sMSNHEXxikQ&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=70980&oh=00_AQOC8yZI9hYsFfRxKxatv-Vm48pit9cxOBbx-iG_x30f1w&oe=6AE138BA", "transcript": null, "ownerUsername": "rowancheung", "ownerFullName": "Rowan Cheung"}, {"shortCode": "Dew1EolOlt3", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dew1EolOlt3/", "caption": "\ud83e\udd4a This robot cage fight just got hit with a cease-and-desist letter.\n\n@frankielap faced three humanoid robots, getting knocked down repeatedly and injuring his hand despite wearing boxing gloves.\n\nHuman pilots controlled each robot remotely through VR, throwing punches without stepping into the cage.\n\nCalifornia\u2019s athletic commission says the event needed its approval. \n\nThe company argues the law defines a match as a contest between two people.\n\nSo if someone fights you through a robot, does that count as two people fighting?", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T16:25:42.000Z", "videoDuration": 59.466667, "videoPlayCount": 91841, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 1518, "commentsCount": 25, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-mad1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/850874094_18022092257944561_7968794671500583148_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ig_cache_key=NDAxMjk0MDY4MjkwNDM2MTg0NzE4MDIyMDkyMjUxOTQ0NTYx.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=5Qlzq7M72bsQ7kNvwG9aSUi&_nc_oc=AdrJcJ75CE3XHUMba7aUYMcyrugdYknDwMHOcR8eJvmr6b8rVQiOa9RuMdjzDiv9ElY&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=3033&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-mad1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=7g__RXnMWYQCeBmK7IENAA&_nc_ss=7a20f&oh=00_AQMQY4t3VI_FiJg7QhGX7YySoMB4ZrzSINNX1yyXMy9tHA&oe=6AE51D4B", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-mad2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNHnM9lJ-Elj-cP_W2LNEtgEITfgdOKNFQRUGjhOpU0Hf3FG9-aoxUM9AYo8MXXnE4CFBACAVzrGByVi3U2TYkznWLfG8if1k7gOWo.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-mad2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=B2qCt1xN-gIQ7kNvwGYYoyv&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6Mjg4MzIwMDE4MTY0NTI3ODEsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjo0LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6NTksInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=1dcffeba40f4eded&_nc_-vamsaO3ZhUCKAJDMywXQE27peNT988YEmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MREAdf4HZeadAQA&_nc_gid=7g__RXnMWYQCeBmK7IENAA&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=70980&oh=00_AQOwDtbY7lssM7OXmoXzAIRYXXjmx9oYk5F8Lky9n7tE9Q&oe=6AE12DAB", "transcript": null, "ownerUsername": "rowancheung", "ownerFullName": "Rowan Cheung"}, {"shortCode": "DexbkXZRozg", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DexbkXZRozg/", "caption": "\ud83d\udc04 Halter, a New Zealand agtech startup, has developed AI-powered smart collars that create virtual fences for cattle, allowing farmers to manage herds remotely through a phone app.\n\nThe collars use sound and vibration cues to guide cows, collect over 6,000 data points per minute, and use machine learning to track grazing, predict disease, and detect breeding cycles.\n\nFounded by Craig Piggott, who grew up on a dairy farm, Halter now manages nearly 650,000 cows across 1,300 farms in New Zealand, Australia, and the United States.\n\nThe company recently raised $220 million at a $2 billion valuation \ud83d\udc40", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T22:00:05.000Z", "videoDuration": 81.166664, "videoPlayCount": 7445, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 189, "commentsCount": 3, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fsyd10-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.71878-15/858798226_2615832382179101_2573571816683701524_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAxMzEwOTk4OTI0MDkwMDgzMjM3NjIyNjMwMTA1ODc1MjA%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=mS3drG9lRaEQ7kNvwFVGLDp&_nc_oc=AdqhLXpR0JQD0j0APWQHnmbELx8jUGNDKV4-OzbX_go0tU38BPRWgFuGCoNzdgI8A-g&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fsyd10-2.fna&_nc_gid=QFsgf-FwApQ57h92UthjUA&_nc_ss=7a20f&oh=00_AQMcU9PiED-z7pUz_K-IFhVRE8mfN-S-CehMip8d_-GuBQ&oe=6AE513C0", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.fsyd10-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMtAJVe9Z1PQUn-PiwO04_AuwTvZne45WcytbUtIGNB65sQUEe5fgkuH-rZKEmbGf_HIN0EdZ3TOZDof2r4Z09MJkLzaRaO80Tg8GM.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=AdqeGLNOxxBw6_GYVh5hF7eVTvxfWHvvdXpA8RJ-nFSqyKa1WARaqYJawwpOtGxXRrc&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.fsyd10-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=EQD07dh4_WQQ7kNvwFjwG24&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0